1
00:00:00,654 --> 00:00:03,954
Um, well, in my defense,
I tell everybody.

2
00:00:03,957 --> 00:00:05,457
Why would you say that?!

3
00:00:05,459 --> 00:00:07,689
(Raj:)We were having a conversation
about past lovers.

4
00:00:07,694 --> 00:00:08,894
We weren't lovers! Come on.

5
00:00:08,896 --> 00:00:10,166
(Penny:)Everyone knows
we didn't sleep together.

6
00:00:10,163 --> 00:00:11,463
(Penny:)We got drunk
and fooled around.

7
00:00:11,465 --> 00:00:13,165
(Penny:)Why couldn't you just
leave me out of it?

8
00:00:13,166 --> 00:00:14,336
(Raj:)Well, we were being honest.

9
00:00:14,334 --> 00:00:16,134
(Raj:)You would leave me
out of the conversation

10
00:00:16,136 --> 00:00:18,036
(Raj:)with the next guy
if you dump Leonard?

11
00:00:18,038 --> 00:00:21,238
(Leonard:)Why say it?
Yes!

12
00:00:21,241 --> 00:00:23,511
(Raj:)Well, I would never
leave you off my list,

13
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:25,180
(Raj:)and not just

14
00:00:25,178 --> 00:00:26,578
(Raj:)because, without you,

15
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,950
(Raj:)we're playing fast and loose
with the word "list."

16
00:00:28,949 --> 00:00:30,919
(Penny:)Well, good job.
Now she hates me.

17
00:00:30,918 --> 00:00:33,118
(Sheldon:)Oh.

18
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,450
(Penny:)Great.

19
00:00:35,455 --> 00:00:37,855
(Sheldon:)On the bright side,
that Oxford study was right.

20
00:00:37,858 --> 00:00:39,828
(Sheldon:)One friend down.

21
00:00:41,228 --> 00:00:45,298
(Sheldon:)I wonder who you're going
to lose next.

22
00:00:45,299 --> 00:00:47,499
(Raj:)You, okay? It's you.
You're-you're next!

23
00:00:49,503 --> 00:00:52,273
(Sheldon:)No. You're crazy about me.

24
00:00:57,477 --> 00:00:59,747
(Penny:)I don't know what Emily's
so upset about anyway.

